Default: \f[CR]5.0\f[R]
.SH EXAMPLES
Point it at a host you actually connect to; a public resolver can be
healthy while your real destination is not:
.IP
.EX
netquality \-\-target your.ssh.host
.EE
.PP
Reduce traffic on a metered mobile link to roughly 0.5 MB/day:
.IP
.EX
netquality \-\-calm\-interval 15 \-\-no\-hops
.EE
.PP
Flag sub\-second freezes, which the default 1000 ms deadline tolerates:
.IP
.EX
netquality \-\-deadline 500
.EE
.SH FILES
.TP
\f[I]$XDG_CACHE_HOME/netquality\-indicator/\f[R]
Generated tray icons, one PNG per quality level.
Regenerated at every start.
